OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 8 MAY
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Bartok
OL,5,     GBartok faces a big decision: stay
OL,6,     Gin Hungary or leave forever?
OL,7,     GDonald Macleod explores the life
OL,8,     Gof one of Hungary's greatest
OL,9,     Gcomposers, who travelled Europe
OL,10,     Grecording folk songs.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GKatie Derham in conversation with
OL,13,     GDame Joan Bakewell to celebrate
OL,14,     GSir David Attenborough at 100.
OL,15,     GPlus Live music from Ben Nabarro,
OL,16,     GTim Horton and Claire Booth.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GA specially curated sequence of
OL,19,     Gsome of Sir David Attenborough's
OL,20,     Gfavourite music tracks,
OL,21,     Gcelebrating his 100th birthday
OL,22,     Gtoday.
